Web Aplication Specialist (Fullstack):
•	Activities related with building, engineering, design, development and audit of web applications;
•	Development back-end em PHP with Symfony 3 e 4, ZendFramework e Yii;
•	Development front-end with HTML5/CSS3, JavaScript (jQuery, Angular, React, Vue, Node.js)
•	Actual structure DevOps: Agile Scrum, with Docker Kubernates, Git, Symfony/Doctrine/PHP with Twig, JavaScript with jQuery, HTML5 and CSS3 with SASS;
